title: Design
description: Visual intent for the focus timer
---

# Design

Values live in `src/styles/tokens.css`. This record holds the intent behind them.

## Overview

Quiet and disciplined. Warm paper tones, a single confident accent for the
active state. No decoration, no motion.

## Colors

- The accent marks the active timer state and nothing else.

| Role   | Property         | Intent                 |
| ------ | ---------------- | ---------------------- |
| ground | `--color-ground` | warm paper page        |
| ink    | `--color-ink`    | primary text           |
| accent | `--color-accent` | the active timer state |

## Typography

- One system sans for every role, with the countdown set heavy.

## Spacing

- An 8px base unit.

## Shapes

| Role    | Property           | When used     |
| ------- | ------------------ | ------------- |
| default | `--radius-default` | cards, inputs |

## Motion

- No animation.

## Iconography

- No custom icons.
